<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22547" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωτός</span></b>  (B), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>kinsman, kinswoman</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωτοί τε γνωταί τε</span>
			<i>brothers</i> and <i>sisters</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.350
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμον γνωτούς τε λιποῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3.174
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.234
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνωτὸν μητρυιῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.697
				</span></i>
			; <i>brother</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.53
			</span></i>; <i>sister</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτὴ . . γνωτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nicaenet.
					1.9
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				3.313
			</span></i>, al.; also, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρωμένη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (Cf. Lett. <i>znuots</i> 'son-in-law, brother-in-law',
			Skt. <i>jñātís</i>
		'relative'.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
